  "goodToKnow": "Die Notlage is an emergency, plight or predicament: in eine Notlage geraten, jemandes Notlage ausnutzen. Under the Schuldenbremse (debt brake), the Bundestag can declare an außergewöhnliche Notlage to allow extra borrowing, as it did during the pandemic. Die Not means need or hardship: Not macht erfinderisch (necessity is the mother of invention). Plural: die Notlagen."
